WEBVTT

00:58.720 --> 01:00.120
Report

01:01.600 --> 01:02.920
The west gate can't hold

01:03.000 --> 01:04.400
General Liu requests reinforcements

01:07.080 --> 01:08.480
Report

01:09.240 --> 01:10.560
General Zhu was shot by an enemy general

01:10.680 --> 01:12.680
Has been withdrawn from the walls

01:27.000 --> 01:27.720
Brother-in-law

01:27.880 --> 01:29.280
We should consider retreat

01:30.240 --> 01:31.600
Yiyang has held until today

01:31.760 --> 01:32.760
No one can blame

01:32.840 --> 01:34.240
The fault on us

01:34.320 --> 01:35.520
Keep our lives

01:35.600 --> 01:37.267
To plan for the future
